  data: {
    LLM: "Keep your 'Safe' cards (4s, 9s, 10s) for when the total is in the high 90s. Play your high-value cards (7s, 8s, Face cards) early while the total is low.\n\nOffensive play: If you have a 10 and the total is 90, play the 10 to jump to 100, forcing the next player to have a zero-value card or lose a life.\n\nCard tracking: If you know many 10s and 4s have been played, you can accurately predict when a player is likely to be trapped.",
    Player: "Keep your 'Safe' cards (4s, 9s, 10s) for when the total is in the high 90s. Play your high-value cards (7s, 8s, Face cards) early while the total is low.\n\nOffensive play: If you have a 10 and the total is 90, play the 10 to jump to 100, forcing the next player to have a zero-value card or lose a life.\n\nCard tracking: If you know many 10s and 4s have been played, you can accurately predict when a player is likely to be trapped.",
